  "title": "DTLS: add tree for unknown data",
  "description": "In the DTLS code path for an unrecognized record type, add a tree item\nthat labels the otherwise-undissected data. The current behaviour claims\nthat data as part of the parent tree item but without any dissection.\n\nAlso add the value for DTLS 1.3 to the `value_string` for SSL versions.\n\nCreated to help with first-pass analysis of #18071.\n\nExample screenshots, generated by loading the capture from #18071 and using Decode As DTLS:\n\nBefore:\n![before](/uploads/bf92d14c1654777148882950b331c6a6/before.png)\n\nAfter:\n![after](/uploads/e6fdb21b34aaa38ed24699c7cc23cd69/after.png)",
